Z||000007||Patrick||05-18-99||05:33 PM||||<br>Pretender, you mentioned "hot-gluing". I've found that anything that I hot-glued together inside my Fiero <b>which was under any "stress"</b> DIDN'T last. It's not that hot here in Vancouver, but I found out that in a BLACK Fiero, it would get hot enough inside the car in the summer to unstick what I had hot-glued.<p>
Z||000008||Gwrider15||06-01-99||11:00 AM||||Gluing the ashtray doors worked for me but only for a short time. I found a better solution was to just order new ones from the Fiero Store, they were cheap. Beats regluing all the time.
